<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND WIN 2ND NZ TOUR MATCH BY 10 WKTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND WIN 2ND NZ TOUR MATCH BY 10 WKTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Northern Districts by 10 wickets to win their second four-day cricket tour match in New Zealand on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Northern Districts first innings 69. Second innings 259 (B. Pocock 69).</p>
<p>England first innings 294. Second innings 38 (N. Knight 24 not out).</p>
